<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Every order at SDF Clothing runs through a single production floor we own outright — no subcontracted buying house sits between your brief and our sewing lines. Communication goes straight to our merchandising and production teams, pricing reflects factory cost rather than agent commission, and you retain full visibility into your supply chain. GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001 certification cover the facility.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Bangladesh's ready-made garment sector exported $39.35 billion in apparel during FY2024-25, an 8.84% increase on the previous year, holding the country's position as the world's second-largest apparel exporter after China. Our minimum order starts at 300 pieces per style, a threshold set to serve brands from a first production run through repeat seasonal orders, backed by in-house tech pack development, fabric sourcing, sampling, bulk manufacturing, quality inspection, and export documentation.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Brands sourcing from Bangladesh sidestep the Section 301 tariffs that add 25% or more to Chinese-made imports entering the US, and a 20% tariff cap negotiated with Washington in late 2025 keeps landed costs predictable. On the EU side, Bangladesh keeps duty-free access under the Everything But Arms scheme through November 2029, even after the country's LDC graduation in November 2026 — a multi-year runway most competing sourcing countries don't offer. Combined with competitive FOB pricing, that supports durable margins for our clients.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>



